1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 34=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:42,790 --> 00:01:45,760
His Majesty is more merciful
than the late Emperor.

7
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:48,760
I hope Prince Han

8
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:51,760
can let go of his ambitions.

9
00:01:58,350 --> 00:01:59,680
The pain medicine is working now.

10
00:02:00,350 --> 00:02:01,680
Get some rest.

11
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,750
I'm not sleepy.

12
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,870
Stay

13
00:02:15,150 --> 00:02:16,560
and talk with me a little longer.

14
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,710
Lu Jian and his father
are both narrow-minded.

15
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:38,560
They suffered
a major setback in court today

16
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:42,080
and certainly won't let it go.

17
00:02:43,430 --> 00:02:44,870
When you go out from now on,

18
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:47,520
take more people with you.

19
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,080
I will.

20
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,280
Don't worry.

21
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,310
Han Liang.

22
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:04,470
Third Place Scholar...

23
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:07,870
Do you resent me

24
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:11,520
for using the imperial edict

25
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,120
to force you to marry me?

26
00:03:18,740 --> 00:03:21,540
♪Our bond runs deep♪

27
00:03:21,940 --> 00:03:25,180
♪Binding us closely together♪

28
00:03:25,500 --> 00:03:28,700
♪After all the questions
life has brought♪

29
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:32,660
♪This love has never
faded in the slightest♪

30
00:03:35,030 --> 00:03:37,590
You don't even know
what I think or want,

31
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:40,630
yet you dared to marry me.

32
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,590
You really are bold.

33
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:05,700
(Six Months Later)

34
00:04:10,870 --> 00:04:11,520
Your Majesty.

35
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:12,710
Tomorrow morning,

36
00:04:12,776 --> 00:04:15,032
Prince Han will pay his respects
at Changling Mausoleum

37
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:17,816
(Details for Departure to the Fief)
and bid farewell to the late Emperor and Empress.

38
00:04:17,912 --> 00:04:20,310
On the twentieth, he will perform
the rites at Fengxian Hall.

39
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:21,800
On the twenty-first,

40
00:04:21,816 --> 00:04:23,600
Prince Han
will bid farewell to Your Majesty.

41
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,720
After that, he will leave the capital

42
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,240
and head directly to his fief.

43
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:29,040
Only three days remain

44
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:30,480
before my brother leaves.

45
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:32,870
My brother and I
were born of the same mother.

46
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:34,750
Once we part,

47
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,070
who knows when we'll meet again?

48
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:40,390
Fengtai.

49
00:04:40,616 --> 00:04:42,952
I remember that aside from
the troops assigned by the court

50
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:45,640
from the Rear Military Command,
Imperial Guard, and Capital Garrison,

51
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:49,480
Prince Han also has 3,000 Tiance Guards
under his command.

52
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:51,800
Every one of them
is a brave and formidable fighter.

53
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:54,000
Indeed, Your Majesty.

54
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,160
The Tiance Guards
are stationed outside the city,

55
00:04:56,200 --> 00:04:57,688
not far from the Shenji Battalion.

56
00:05:00,824 --> 00:05:02,390
Before Prince Han leaves the capital,

57
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,630
keep a close watch on them.

58
00:05:04,430 --> 00:05:05,560
It's bitterly cold.

59
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:07,870
Don't let the soldiers
go hungry or freeze

60
00:05:08,190 --> 00:05:09,360
and cause trouble.

61
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:14,600
Tomorrow, I will escort several carts
of grain and charcoal there.

62
00:05:14,950 --> 00:05:15,920
I'll be sure to take care

63
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,430
so they will appreciate
Your Majesty's grace.

64
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:24,270
Chen Qi is a veteran general
highly valued by the late Emperor.

65
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,600
Unless absolutely necessary,

66
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,304
do not come into conflict with him.

67
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:29,680
I understand.

68
00:05:36,070 --> 00:05:37,040
This firearm

69
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,600
was just forged by the Imperial Armory.

70
00:05:38,648 --> 00:05:40,160
(Golden Talisman)
It's more powerful than previous models.

71
00:05:40,170 --> 00:05:42,210
I grant you special permission
to carry it with you.

72
00:05:42,264 --> 00:05:44,760
You need not go through Chen Qi
or the firearms supervisor.

73
00:05:45,816 --> 00:05:47,000
Military regulations state

74
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,856
that firearms cannot
be taken out of the camp.

75
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:49,720
Your Majesty

76
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:53,950
truly shows Deputy Commander Lin
exceptional favor.

77
00:05:58,248 --> 00:06:00,008
Your Majesty has shown me immense grace.

78
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,040
I would give my life to repay it.

79
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:09,220
(Mahavira Hall)

80
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:45,480
(Today is Lanxiang's birthday.)

81
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:48,070
(May the Bodhisattva bless me.)

82
00:06:49,270 --> 00:06:51,870
(May I soon find where
Lanxiang's remains are buried.)

83
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,750
(May I offer incense to her in person.)

84
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:56,950
(And bring my parents some peace.)

85
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,920
Young Lady.

86
00:07:36,120 --> 00:07:37,750
Master, please use this silver

87
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:39,120
to keep an eternal lamp burning.

88
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,720
Amitabha.

89
00:07:41,848 --> 00:07:43,430
Thank you for taking us in, Master.

90
00:07:43,830 --> 00:07:46,870
Thank you, Master.

91
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:47,950
Sorry to trouble you.

92
00:07:48,072 --> 00:07:48,800
Don't mention it.

93
00:07:49,070 --> 00:07:49,560
Come on.

94
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:52,270
Master, you're truly compassionate.

95
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,070
Thank you for taking us in.

96
00:07:54,070 --> 00:07:54,872
This way, please.

97
00:07:54,888 --> 00:07:55,600
Thank you so much.

98
00:07:56,190 --> 00:07:56,630
Let's go.

99
00:07:56,630 --> 00:07:57,480
Thank you, Master.

100
00:07:58,664 --> 00:08:00,480
The benefactors
who were speaking just now

101
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,270
are villagers from outside Xizhi Gate.

102
00:08:02,390 --> 00:08:04,870
All the dogs in their village
died suddenly overnight.

103
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:08,190
They say ghost soldiers passed through
and the place is haunted.

104
00:08:08,216 --> 00:08:10,810
So some of the villagers want to stay
at the temple for a few days

105
00:08:10,824 --> 00:08:11,976
for peace of mind.

106
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:17,630
Take care, young lady.

107
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,928
Young Master, what are you doing here?

108
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,480
Don't you want to ask

109
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,480
what I'm wishing for?

110
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,840
Whatever you wish for,

111
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,480
I hope your wish comes true.

112
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,510
Today

113
00:08:58,870 --> 00:09:00,000
is your birthday.

114
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:02,630
We were on the boat
for your birthday last year

115
00:09:02,808 --> 00:09:04,240
and couldn't celebrate it properly.

116
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:05,510
This year,

117
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:08,000
I came back early,
especially to be with you

118
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,280
and give you
a proper birthday celebration.

119
00:09:22,152 --> 00:09:24,520
Thank you for going
to all this trouble, Young Master.

120
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:43,150
My lady.

121
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,440
Please.

122
00:09:55,540 --> 00:10:05,100
(May we love each other
and grow old together.)

123
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:13,260
(Lin Family Retreat Outside the Capital)

124
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,240
A toast to the birthday girl.

125
00:10:39,240 --> 00:10:40,390
Don't drink too quickly.

126
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,240
The liquor will go to your head.

127
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:43,550
Take it slowly.

128
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:50,080
This cup is to you, Young Master.

129
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,480
Thank you

130
00:10:51,960 --> 00:10:53,928
for bringing me
to the retreat especially

131
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:55,720
to celebrate my birthday.

132
00:10:57,304 --> 00:10:58,080
I'll drink it all.

133
00:10:58,750 --> 00:10:59,630
Take your time.

134
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:14,360
Did something

135
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:18,080
upset you today?

136
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:22,080
No.

137
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:28,240
A daughter's birthday

138
00:11:28,744 --> 00:11:31,176
is the day her mother
suffered to give birth to her.

139
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,240
I just

140
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,120
miss my parents in Jinling.

141
00:11:38,630 --> 00:11:40,630
Didn't you just receive
a letter from your father?

142
00:11:41,048 --> 00:11:42,750
Your parents are both in good health,

143
00:11:42,904 --> 00:11:44,480
and business at the shop is going well.

144
00:11:44,904 --> 00:11:46,632
They told you not to worry about them.

145
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,360
You're right.

146
00:12:04,150 --> 00:12:05,120
This retreat

147
00:12:05,496 --> 00:12:06,630
was purchased by Grandfather

148
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:08,630
when he was Minister of Personnel.

149
00:12:09,720 --> 00:12:10,630
It's rather remote,

150
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,840
but it has a hot spring
that's very good for your health.

151
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,720
It's bitterly cold outside.

152
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:18,240
Let's stay here for a few days

153
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:19,840
so you can relax as well.

154
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,840
What about everyone
back at the residence?

155
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,080
Since we came to the capital,

156
00:12:38,424 --> 00:12:40,630
without Concubine Zhou
watching her day and night,

157
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,550
Suhua has clearly
become much more cheerful.

158
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,870
Jinlan is in better spirits, too,

159
00:12:46,790 --> 00:12:49,510
and his health seems better
than in previous years.

160
00:12:52,270 --> 00:12:53,390
With him at the residence,

161
00:12:53,992 --> 00:12:56,030
it won't matter if we
don't go back for ten days

162
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,550
or even half a month.

163
00:14:03,150 --> 00:14:04,360
Being a little tipsy

164
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:07,480
is just right.

165
00:14:10,184 --> 00:14:12,024
If I drink any more,
I'll really get drunk.

166
00:14:13,608 --> 00:14:15,000
Then I'll start talking nonsense.

167
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,320
That would spoil the mood.

168
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:20,600
Today

169
00:14:21,510 --> 00:14:22,630
is your birthday.

170
00:14:23,870 --> 00:14:25,080
Why not get drunk for once?

171
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:33,080
That's right.

172
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,630
Today is my birthday.

173
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:48,720
Lanxiang.

174
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,600
I'm drunk.

175
00:14:58,240 --> 00:14:59,240
I'm going back.

176
00:15:09,150 --> 00:15:10,630
Did I do something wrong

177
00:15:11,670 --> 00:15:12,670
to upset you?

178
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,670
You went to all this trouble
to celebrate my birthday.

179
00:15:22,870 --> 00:15:24,550
How could I not appreciate it?

180
00:15:25,510 --> 00:15:26,440
If anyone was wrong,

181
00:15:28,150 --> 00:15:29,320
it was me.

182
00:15:31,128 --> 00:15:32,510
I shouldn't have drunk so much.

183
00:15:57,540 --> 00:16:01,860
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

184
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:08,030
The longevity noodles are here.

185
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:14,460
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

186
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:17,700
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

187
00:16:18,460 --> 00:16:20,860
♪Though all the world may fade♪

188
00:16:20,860 --> 00:16:23,540
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

189
00:16:25,340 --> 00:16:29,700
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

190
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:36,620
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

191
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:42,180
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

192
00:16:42,740 --> 00:16:45,220
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

193
00:16:46,540 --> 00:16:52,260
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

194
00:16:52,260 --> 00:16:57,580
(Spring Tidings from Solitary Hill)

195
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,680
Why does it sound

196
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,110
like someone's performing opera?

197
00:17:08,392 --> 00:17:09,672
You heard right, Young Madam.

198
00:17:09,752 --> 00:17:10,920
Young Master specially invited

199
00:17:10,930 --> 00:17:13,450
the Xiaofurong Troupe from the city
so you could enjoy some opera

200
00:17:13,464 --> 00:17:14,712
and get some proper rest.

201
00:17:15,070 --> 00:17:16,070
Ting Lizi is here?

202
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,310
Young Madam is back.

203
00:17:26,456 --> 00:17:28,270
I didn't know
the troupe leader was coming.

204
00:17:28,510 --> 00:17:30,830
Forgive me for not welcoming you.

205
00:17:30,984 --> 00:17:32,750
Young Master Lin
is paying me well enough.

206
00:17:32,984 --> 00:17:34,200
Whether you welcome me or not,

207
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,680
I don't really care.

208
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:39,030
Young Madam.

209
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:41,080
You haven't been to the troupe
for quite some time.

210
00:17:41,090 --> 00:17:41,880
I've been thinking

211
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:43,270
of asking you for a reward.

212
00:17:44,392 --> 00:17:46,520
What could possibly
be worth paying you for?

213
00:17:47,848 --> 00:17:49,920
Last month, I went out
of the city with the troupe

214
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,830
to perform for Commander Tian.

215
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,960
I went to the latrine along the way

216
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,200
and ran into Lu Jian.

217
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:56,920
He was acting furtively,

218
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:58,440
like he had something to hide.

219
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:02,110
You once asked me to hire
some thugs to beat him up,

220
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:03,830
so I recognized him from a distance.

221
00:18:05,070 --> 00:18:06,200
It looks like

222
00:18:06,968 --> 00:18:09,270
Lu Jian has found himself
a powerful patron in Prince Han.

223
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,790
You should be careful.

224
00:18:14,510 --> 00:18:15,640
Thank you for the warning.

225
00:18:18,750 --> 00:18:20,160
Shunqing and I have made up.

226
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:21,790
Sit down and enjoy the opera.

227
00:18:23,790 --> 00:18:24,790
Wait over there.

228
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,950
(All the dogs in the village
outside Xizhi Gate)

229
00:18:26,968 --> 00:18:28,720
(died suddenly overnight.)

230
00:18:29,030 --> 00:18:31,000
They say ghost soldiers passed through.

231
00:18:31,736 --> 00:18:33,400
Didn't they report it
to the authorities?

232
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:34,720
They did.

233
00:18:34,830 --> 00:18:36,760
The Wanping County Office
refused to handle it.

234
00:18:36,790 --> 00:18:39,224
Later, the villagers took the matter
to Shuntian Prefecture.

235
00:18:39,270 --> 00:18:40,550
I heard Judicial Officer Dai

236
00:18:40,590 --> 00:18:42,270
personally brought constables there.

237
00:18:42,350 --> 00:18:43,550
(They didn't find anything.)

238
00:18:43,550 --> 00:18:44,200
(Dai Rui...)

239
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:47,920
I remember

240
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:50,310
Commander Tian of the Tiance Guards
is an avid opera lover.

241
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:52,310
He especially enjoys your performances.

242
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:54,400
Whenever I visit
the troupe on the fifteenth,

243
00:18:54,440 --> 00:18:55,350
you're never there.

244
00:18:55,368 --> 00:18:57,496
You're always performing
for the Tiance Guards.

245
00:18:57,510 --> 00:18:58,400
You remember correctly.

246
00:18:59,030 --> 00:19:01,110
Commander Tian's mother is from Suzhou.

247
00:19:01,510 --> 00:19:03,680
He grew up listening
to southern opera with his mother.

248
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:06,270
Every month, he has me perform
at his residence for a day

249
00:19:06,270 --> 00:19:07,576
to satisfy his craving for opera.

250
00:19:09,350 --> 00:19:10,550
The fifteenth has just passed.

251
00:19:11,030 --> 00:19:13,200
Did you perform
for Commander Tian this month?

252
00:19:15,510 --> 00:19:18,070
I heard Prince Han
is leaving for his fief.

253
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:20,550
I figured Commander Tian
would have to go with him,

254
00:19:20,744 --> 00:19:23,740
so I thought he'd surely ask me to
perform a few more times before leaving.

255
00:19:24,310 --> 00:19:25,270
But to my surprise,

256
00:19:25,270 --> 00:19:27,000
he hasn't invited me
to perform even once.

257
00:19:27,310 --> 00:19:28,510
I thought another troupe

258
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:29,790
had stolen my business.

259
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:32,880
I suppose he's been
too busy with official duties

260
00:19:33,350 --> 00:19:34,400
to enjoy any opera.

261
00:19:39,590 --> 00:19:40,720
He's about to leave.

262
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:43,416
There shouldn't be much
left to keep him busy.

263
00:19:49,790 --> 00:19:51,640
I really must thank you
and Shunqing this time.

264
00:19:51,650 --> 00:19:53,990
I just remembered something urgent
that I need to go out and take care of.

265
00:19:54,070 --> 00:19:55,500
I'm sorry you came
all this way for nothing.

266
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:56,808
You'll still be paid as promised.

267
00:20:00,590 --> 00:20:01,270
Lizi.

268
00:20:03,848 --> 00:20:05,640
Please wait
until I return before leaving.

269
00:20:11,640 --> 00:20:12,070
All right.

270
00:20:12,312 --> 00:20:14,472
We'll wait for you to return
before we leave.

271
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:21,270
Young Madam, you're going out?

272
00:20:21,280 --> 00:20:22,232
Where are you going?

273
00:20:22,960 --> 00:20:24,880
Did Young Master go to
the Tiance Guards today?

274
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:25,350
Yes.

275
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:26,960
Jiugao said His Majesty ordered him

276
00:20:26,960 --> 00:20:28,160
to deliver grain and charcoal.

277
00:20:30,510 --> 00:20:31,200
Xiaolian.

278
00:20:31,624 --> 00:20:33,160
Have a carriage prepared immediately.

279
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:35,300
Find a servant who grew up locally
to come with us.

280
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:39,640
Yes.

281
00:20:43,240 --> 00:20:43,720
Yuchan.

282
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:46,740
Take two servants and hurry back to
the city to find Second Young Master.

283
00:20:46,750 --> 00:20:47,350
Tell him...

284
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:49,160
Tell him...

285
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:52,390
Tell him Young Master wants bean rice
cooked over bean stalks.

286
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:54,140
Have Second Young Master
prepare it at once.

287
00:20:54,152 --> 00:20:55,816
Young Master wants bean rice?

288
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:57,440
When does he want it?

289
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:58,640
I don't know.

290
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:02,510
We're short on time. Hurry!

291
00:21:03,240 --> 00:21:03,720
Yes.

292
00:21:13,110 --> 00:21:14,030
After I leave,

293
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,270
have the main gate barred.

294
00:21:15,350 --> 00:21:16,350
Lock the side gate tight.

295
00:21:16,510 --> 00:21:17,640
Have two alert servants

296
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:18,880
keep watch outside at all times.

297
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:20,110
Don't go outside.

298
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:21,830
Stay hidden indoors.

299
00:21:26,400 --> 00:21:28,110
Young Madam, the carriage is ready.

300
00:21:28,270 --> 00:21:30,000
Let's leave at once. Find Young Master.

301
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:36,350
Hyah!

302
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,550
You two, get inside, quickly!

303
00:21:42,960 --> 00:21:43,400
Hurry!

304
00:21:44,648 --> 00:21:46,410
Bar the main gate.
Lock the side gate tight.

305
00:21:46,424 --> 00:21:47,550
Until Young Madam returns,

306
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:48,720
no one is allowed in or out.

307
00:21:48,920 --> 00:21:49,590
Understood?

308
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,360
- Yes.
- Yes.

309
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:55,940
(Tiance Guards)

310
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:58,980
(Tiance Guards Encampment
Outside the Capital)

311
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,680
(Pacification Officer Qian)
Lin Jinqi is coming to deliver supplies.

312
00:22:05,690 --> 00:22:07,592
(Lower Fifth-Rank of the Tiance Guards)
He will surely enter the camp.

313
00:22:07,880 --> 00:22:09,350
Once they're inside,

314
00:22:10,270 --> 00:22:11,640
close the camp gates immediately.

315
00:22:13,350 --> 00:22:14,640
Trap them inside.

316
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:18,720
Kill them on the spot.

317
00:22:19,256 --> 00:22:20,728
Prince Han has given the order.

318
00:22:21,550 --> 00:22:23,720
Ten taels of silver for each head.

319
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:25,750
100 taels

320
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:27,920
for Lin Jinqi's head.

321
00:22:28,550 --> 00:22:29,270
- Yes.
- Yes.

322
00:22:39,590 --> 00:22:40,880
- Let's go.
- Hurry.

323
00:22:51,550 --> 00:22:52,400
Who goes there?

324
00:22:55,112 --> 00:22:56,030
(Golden Talisman)

325
00:22:56,030 --> 00:22:58,072
Assistant Commander
of the Central Military Command.

326
00:22:58,080 --> 00:23:00,328
I'm here by imperial order
to reward the Tiance Guards.

327
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:22,110
Deputy Commander Lin, welcome.

328
00:23:22,180 --> 00:23:24,072
Forgive me
for not coming out to greet you.

329
00:23:24,136 --> 00:23:26,150
No need for formalities,
Pacification Officer Qian.

330
00:23:26,180 --> 00:23:27,450
You've had a difficult journey.

331
00:23:28,240 --> 00:23:28,880
Please come in.

332
00:23:41,830 --> 00:23:43,830
The snow is getting heavier
by the minute.

333
00:23:43,848 --> 00:23:45,640
The roads
will only get harder to travel.

334
00:23:46,232 --> 00:23:47,992
I still have matters to attend to today,

335
00:23:48,392 --> 00:23:50,120
so I won't trouble you by going inside.

336
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:53,510
These supplies
are a gift from His Majesty.

337
00:23:54,104 --> 00:23:55,830
Please have the men of the Tiance Guards

338
00:23:56,030 --> 00:23:56,790
carry them inside.

339
00:23:57,784 --> 00:23:58,744
There's no hurry.

340
00:23:59,510 --> 00:24:01,920
We've prepared warm liquor
and hot food inside the camp.

341
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,830
You've come
all this way through the snow.

342
00:24:04,070 --> 00:24:05,720
Come in and have a few drinks.

343
00:24:05,830 --> 00:24:07,336
Warm yourselves up before you leave.

344
00:24:12,310 --> 00:24:12,960
Today,

345
00:24:13,576 --> 00:24:15,384
I really do have
other matters to attend to.

346
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:17,440
It's bitterly cold,

347
00:24:18,248 --> 00:24:20,310
and I shouldn't
keep my wife waiting too long.

348
00:24:35,030 --> 00:24:36,400
Madam Lin came as well?

349
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,930
My wife and I have been at odds

350
00:24:39,400 --> 00:24:41,160
these past few days.

351
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:43,270
I only just managed
to make peace with her.

352
00:24:45,160 --> 00:24:47,030
I hope you'll understand.

353
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:49,640
I'll treat you to a drink another day.

354
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:57,640
I've long heard of your
deep devotion to your wife.

355
00:24:57,920 --> 00:24:59,000
It's truly admirable.

356
00:24:59,550 --> 00:25:00,270
In that case,

357
00:25:01,720 --> 00:25:02,790
I won't take up

358
00:25:03,510 --> 00:25:05,270
any more of your time.

359
00:25:05,496 --> 00:25:06,920
When I meet His Majesty tomorrow,

360
00:25:07,550 --> 00:25:09,680
I'll be sure to put
in a good word for you.

361
00:25:10,488 --> 00:25:11,400
I will take my leave.

362
00:25:11,830 --> 00:25:12,480
Take care.

363
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:29,200
Take care, Deputy Commander Lin.

364
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:48,350
I'll let you live a little longer.

365
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:57,848
There is indeed something amiss
with the Tiance Guards.

366
00:25:58,400 --> 00:26:00,070
If you hadn't come to warn me,

367
00:26:00,200 --> 00:26:02,200
I would have gone
into the camp to investigate.

368
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:03,350
By now,

369
00:26:03,544 --> 00:26:05,128
I might well have been in grave danger.

370
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:06,110
But

371
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,880
what made you think

372
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,720
the Tiance Guards were up to something?

373
00:26:10,830 --> 00:26:12,400
Commander Tian is an avid opera lover.

374
00:26:12,488 --> 00:26:14,296
He listens to opera
every month without fail.

375
00:26:14,720 --> 00:26:16,070
He's about to leave the capital,

376
00:26:16,550 --> 00:26:18,680
yet he hasn't summoned any performers.

377
00:26:20,110 --> 00:26:21,440
Such a sudden change in habit

378
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:23,110
must have a reason behind it.

379
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:26,350
All the dogs in a village
in Wanping County

380
00:26:26,440 --> 00:26:27,640
died suddenly overnight.

381
00:26:28,070 --> 00:26:30,350
The villagers say
ghost soldiers passed through.

382
00:26:31,030 --> 00:26:33,070
And the official sent to investigate

383
00:26:33,270 --> 00:26:34,110
was Dai Rui.

384
00:26:36,640 --> 00:26:38,030
That is strange,

385
00:26:38,616 --> 00:26:41,128
but what does it have
to do with the Tiance Guards?

386
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:43,000
That village lies outside Xizhi Gate,

387
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,880
not far from the city walls.

388
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,880
Even if the Tiance Guards

389
00:26:46,936 --> 00:26:48,904
planned to enter
the city through Xizhi Gate,

390
00:26:48,920 --> 00:26:50,990
there would be no need
to kill the dogs beforehand.

391
00:26:51,200 --> 00:26:51,880
Besides,

392
00:26:52,152 --> 00:26:54,590
the Imperial Guards defending
the city are all elite troops.

393
00:26:54,808 --> 00:26:56,440
With only three thousand Tiance Guards,

394
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:58,070
they could never breach the capital.

395
00:26:58,750 --> 00:26:59,960
You have a point.

396
00:27:01,790 --> 00:27:04,350
Lu Jian and his father
have already sided with Prince Han

397
00:27:05,590 --> 00:27:06,920
and have dealings with Tian Fang.

398
00:27:08,790 --> 00:27:10,160
Lu Jian's father, Lu Ju,

399
00:27:10,344 --> 00:27:12,840
is Director of the Construction Office,
Ministry of Works.

400
00:27:13,830 --> 00:27:14,880
His rank may be low,

401
00:27:16,110 --> 00:27:17,640
but he has access to the Archives

402
00:27:18,392 --> 00:27:20,070
and could steal the construction plans.

403
00:27:21,920 --> 00:27:24,480
Prince Han has already obtained
the plans for the city walls.

404
00:27:28,536 --> 00:27:29,950
I'm afraid I still don't understand.

405
00:27:30,110 --> 00:27:31,240
Please explain.

406
00:27:34,550 --> 00:27:35,920
I once read a passage

407
00:27:36,160 --> 00:27:37,200
in an ancient text

408
00:27:37,200 --> 00:27:40,160
describing the walls of Chang'an
during the Sui and Tang dynasties.

409
00:27:41,160 --> 00:27:42,790
To drain standing water from the city

410
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:44,070
and prevent flooding,

411
00:27:44,550 --> 00:27:46,920
underground drainage
culverts were built.

412
00:27:47,310 --> 00:27:49,720
The widest could accommodate a carriage.

413
00:27:49,750 --> 00:27:52,200
The narrowest
could accommodate one person.

414
00:27:52,830 --> 00:27:54,680
Although the walls of our capital

415
00:27:54,728 --> 00:27:56,984
cannot compare with those
of the Sui and Tang dynasties,

416
00:27:57,320 --> 00:27:59,352
the culverts may not
be wide enough for a carriage,

417
00:28:00,510 --> 00:28:02,680
but a person should certainly
be able to pass through.

418
00:28:04,104 --> 00:28:06,296
The villagers said ghost soldiers
had passed through.

419
00:28:07,510 --> 00:28:08,920
It wasn't really a haunting.

420
00:28:10,344 --> 00:28:13,130
The Tiance Guards had slipped
into Wanping County under cover of night

421
00:28:13,144 --> 00:28:14,780
and hidden their troops
in the drainage culverts.

422
00:28:14,790 --> 00:28:16,350
They killed all the dogs in the village

423
00:28:16,550 --> 00:28:18,590
first, to keep their barking
from drawing attention,

424
00:28:18,880 --> 00:28:19,550
and second,

425
00:28:20,110 --> 00:28:22,350
to frighten the villagers away
so they could act freely.

426
00:28:22,440 --> 00:28:24,310
A matter that should have
been handled by the county office

427
00:28:24,310 --> 00:28:26,310
somehow ended up
with Shuntian Prefecture

428
00:28:26,510 --> 00:28:27,720
and was assigned to Dai Rui.

429
00:28:28,840 --> 00:28:30,720
That was also to cover up
the hidden troops.

430
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:33,340
No wonder Pacification Officer Qian
wanted to kill me.

431
00:28:33,928 --> 00:28:35,550
It's because the Tiance Guards' camp

432
00:28:36,160 --> 00:28:37,440
is already empty.

433
00:28:37,550 --> 00:28:39,440
Deputy Commander Lin.
You've had a long journey.

434
00:28:39,656 --> 00:28:40,400
Please come in.

435
00:28:45,304 --> 00:28:46,888
It's not just the Tiance Guards.

436
00:28:47,400 --> 00:28:50,170
Prince Han went to the late Emperor's
mausoleum today to bid farewell.

437
00:28:51,640 --> 00:28:53,270
The Changling Guards
are stationed there.

438
00:28:53,288 --> 00:28:55,390
Some of their commanders must
be tired of guarding the mausoleum

439
00:28:55,400 --> 00:28:57,510
and persuaded by Prince Han
to join his rebellion.

440
00:28:58,392 --> 00:29:01,110
With the Tiance Guards inside
and the Changling Guards outside,

441
00:29:01,192 --> 00:29:02,640
they can attack from both sides.

442
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:05,320
The Imperial Guards will have
little chance of stopping them.

443
00:29:06,216 --> 00:29:07,550
The Imperial City is in danger.

444
00:29:07,640 --> 00:29:08,640
Stop the carriage!

445
00:29:11,510 --> 00:29:12,110
Jiugao.

446
00:29:13,240 --> 00:29:13,750
Young Master.

447
00:29:13,784 --> 00:29:15,000
Ride back to the city at once.

448
00:29:15,010 --> 00:29:16,700
Go to the palace
and see Chief Steward Wang.

449
00:29:16,710 --> 00:29:18,340
Ask him to inform
His Majesty immediately!

450
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:19,500
The Imperial City
must be heavily guarded.

451
00:29:19,510 --> 00:29:19,920
Yes.

452
00:29:27,176 --> 00:29:28,830
I should escort you back to the retreat,

453
00:29:28,840 --> 00:29:30,710
but Vice Commander Chen
of the Shenji Battalion

454
00:29:30,728 --> 00:29:32,000
once fought alongside Prince Han.

455
00:29:32,110 --> 00:29:34,820
They were comrades-in-arms. I must
hurry back to the Shenji Battalion

456
00:29:34,830 --> 00:29:37,180
in case Vice Commander Chen
leads the battalion in rebellion.

457
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,830
Your duty comes first.

458
00:29:39,030 --> 00:29:40,030
Don't worry about me.

459
00:29:59,976 --> 00:30:01,980
Nanke, come with me
back to the Shenji Battalion.

460
00:30:02,110 --> 00:30:04,200
The rest of you,
escort Madam back to the retreat.

461
00:30:04,680 --> 00:30:06,030
- Yes!
- Yes!

462
00:30:09,384 --> 00:30:11,790
If Prince Han leads the Changling Guards
against Xizhi Gate,

463
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:13,640
they'll have to take this road.

464
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,240
Take the smaller road.

465
00:30:15,320 --> 00:30:17,912
Once you return to the retreat,
stay inside with the gates shut.

466
00:30:18,310 --> 00:30:19,200
Wait for word from me.

467
00:30:23,880 --> 00:30:25,110
Sun Yong, let's go!

468
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:49,350
Hyah!

469
00:31:08,110 --> 00:31:09,200
Young Master!

470
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:21,750
Take care!

471
00:31:50,580 --> 00:31:56,380
♪The golden sunset♪

472
00:31:58,460 --> 00:32:00,780
♪All things fall silent♪

473
00:32:00,780 --> 00:32:04,140
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

474
00:32:04,820 --> 00:32:07,980
♪My restless heart♪

475
00:32:08,340 --> 00:32:11,780
♪Seeks a place to anchor♪

476
00:32:12,540 --> 00:32:17,940
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

477
00:32:21,340 --> 00:32:23,780
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

478
00:32:23,780 --> 00:32:28,620
♪For withholding its light♪

479
00:32:28,620 --> 00:32:32,300
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

480
00:32:32,300 --> 00:32:36,300
♪Still live and thrive♪

481
00:32:36,300 --> 00:32:41,180
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

482
00:32:41,180 --> 00:32:43,700
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

483
00:32:44,020 --> 00:32:48,180
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

484
00:32:48,180 --> 00:32:53,620
♪You and I will walk there together♪

485
00:32:54,310 --> 00:32:55,200
Lin Jinqi!

486
00:32:55,510 --> 00:32:56,640
If you want to slap me,

487
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,830
wait until I come back!

488
00:33:09,380 --> 00:33:13,380
(Deep Roots, Lasting Grace)

489
00:33:22,270 --> 00:33:23,640
This tea smells wonderful.

490
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:24,920
Jinlan, can you guess

491
00:33:25,030 --> 00:33:26,590
what I put in this teapot?

492
00:33:29,510 --> 00:33:30,270
Astragalus.

493
00:33:30,790 --> 00:33:31,510
Crabapple.

494
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:33,000
Red dates.

495
00:33:35,030 --> 00:33:36,550
You have a keen nose.

496
00:33:36,680 --> 00:33:39,224
My nose has been steeped in
the smell of medicine for years.

497
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:40,480
It's hardly that keen.

498
00:33:41,880 --> 00:33:43,680
I remembered you
took my pulse this morning

499
00:33:44,440 --> 00:33:45,440
and said I was low on qi.

500
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:49,160
And I happened to be craving apples,

501
00:33:51,070 --> 00:33:52,830
so I knew you'd use them
to replenish my qi.

502
00:34:00,640 --> 00:34:01,880
The snow will be deep tomorrow.

503
00:34:02,240 --> 00:34:03,790
I'll ask Xiulai and Xiuwan to join us.

504
00:34:04,248 --> 00:34:05,624
Let's build a snowman together.

505
00:34:06,110 --> 00:34:06,590
All right.

506
00:34:14,328 --> 00:34:15,190
Second Young Master.

507
00:34:18,480 --> 00:34:19,230
Second Young Madam.

508
00:34:21,512 --> 00:34:22,840
No need to rush. Take your time.

509
00:34:23,190 --> 00:34:24,190
Young Master wants

510
00:34:24,440 --> 00:34:25,760
bean rice cooked over bean stalks.

511
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:29,230
Who told you to say that?

512
00:34:29,590 --> 00:34:30,630
Young Madam told me

513
00:34:30,710 --> 00:34:32,710
to hurry back
and tell you those exact words.

514
00:34:33,070 --> 00:34:34,710
I don't know what they mean either.

515
00:34:35,208 --> 00:34:37,032
Burning bean stalks to cook the beans.

516
00:34:41,590 --> 00:34:42,760
What Lanxiang means is that

517
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:46,030
brothers are turning
on each other for the throne.

518
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:50,230
Prince Han is going to rebel.

519
00:34:52,590 --> 00:34:53,230
Don't panic.

520
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:56,616
The more urgent things are,
the calmer we must be.

521
00:34:58,190 --> 00:34:58,760
Suhua.

522
00:34:59,176 --> 00:35:02,000
Take Fufang with you. Tell Xiulai
and Xiuwan that my heart condition

523
00:35:02,010 --> 00:35:04,216
has suddenly flared up
and bring them to the side gate.

524
00:35:04,230 --> 00:35:06,250
Tell them they're accompanying me
to see a physician.

525
00:35:06,280 --> 00:35:07,384
We're leaving the residence?

526
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:08,630
Where are we going?

527
00:35:08,720 --> 00:35:11,250
Once the rebels enter the city,
they're bound to loot everywhere.

528
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:13,350
The court's powerful families
will be their first targets.

529
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:15,100
We should stay out
of their way if we can.

530
00:35:15,110 --> 00:35:17,150
As for where we're going,
I've already made plans.

531
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:18,070
Don't worry.

532
00:35:18,320 --> 00:35:19,030
But Jinlan,

533
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:20,030
your health...

534
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:22,000
I'm fine.

535
00:35:22,552 --> 00:35:24,792
I've been in better health
this year than in years past.

536
00:35:25,150 --> 00:35:25,800
I can manage.

537
00:35:28,184 --> 00:35:29,920
I still need to discuss with Butler Yang

538
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:31,480
how to keep the servants safe.

539
00:35:32,230 --> 00:35:33,840
Go find Xiulai and Xiuwan.

540
00:35:34,030 --> 00:35:35,190
We'll meet at the side gate.

541
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:36,880
All right.

542
00:35:41,190 --> 00:35:41,670
Yuchan.

543
00:35:41,720 --> 00:35:44,312
Go to the servants' quarters
and find several sets of clothes.

544
00:35:44,510 --> 00:35:45,550
The plainer, the better.

545
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:48,710
Once you have them, go straight
to the side gate and meet us there.

546
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:50,216
Forget about our belongings.

547
00:35:50,480 --> 00:35:51,990
Staying alive matters most right now.

548
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:52,800
Yes.

549
00:36:07,300 --> 00:36:11,320
(Shenji Battalion Encampment
Outside the Capital)

550
00:36:11,320 --> 00:36:13,280
(Chen Qi, Lower First-Rank)
Prince Han is going to rebel?

551
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,110
(Vice Commander)

552
00:36:14,110 --> 00:36:15,880
The Tiance Guards
have entered the Imperial City

553
00:36:15,880 --> 00:36:16,880
(Commander of the Shenji Battalion)
through the underground drainage culverts.

554
00:36:17,110 --> 00:36:18,210
The situation is critical.

555
00:36:18,264 --> 00:36:20,270
Vice Commander Chen,
please make a decision at once

556
00:36:20,280 --> 00:36:21,630
and lead the troops
to reinforce the city now.

557
00:36:21,816 --> 00:36:23,464
(Palace Eunuch Supervising
the Shenji Battalion, Fourth-Rank)

558
00:36:23,470 --> 00:36:24,408
(Imperial Horse Directorate)

559
00:36:25,000 --> 00:36:26,030
Deputy Commander Lin.

560
00:36:26,710 --> 00:36:28,070
Don't make such alarming claims.

561
00:36:29,000 --> 00:36:31,150
Prince Han is about
to leave the capital for his fief.

562
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,880
Why would he suddenly rebel?

563
00:36:33,656 --> 00:36:36,320
Without an imperial edict or orders
from the Ministry of War,

564
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:39,710
moving troops without authorization
is a serious crime.

565
00:36:43,110 --> 00:36:44,110
In my view,

566
00:36:44,710 --> 00:36:45,840
we should first send someone

567
00:36:45,840 --> 00:36:47,800
to Xizhi Gate to investigate

568
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,710
whether this is true.

569
00:36:51,150 --> 00:36:53,070
Vice Commander Chen has a point.

570
00:36:54,070 --> 00:36:58,280
But we cannot ignore
Deputy Commander Lin's warning either.

571
00:37:28,360 --> 00:37:29,000
Chen Qi.

572
00:37:29,048 --> 00:37:30,070
Are you planning to rebel?

573
00:37:31,550 --> 00:37:32,880
So what if I am?

574
00:37:33,550 --> 00:37:34,880
The late Emperor won this realm

575
00:37:35,510 --> 00:37:37,000
through rebellion.

576
00:37:38,808 --> 00:37:40,150
If the late Emperor could rebel,

577
00:37:41,670 --> 00:37:42,510
then Prince Han

578
00:37:43,400 --> 00:37:44,590
can do the same.

579
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,360
Do you hear the gunfire?

580
00:38:24,104 --> 00:38:25,440
Let's go see what's happening.

581
00:38:29,580 --> 00:38:31,900
(Golden Talisman)

582
00:38:31,960 --> 00:38:33,880
Chen Qi colluded
with Prince Han in rebellion

583
00:38:34,248 --> 00:38:35,880
and killed the two supervising eunuchs.

584
00:38:36,400 --> 00:38:37,840
He has been executed on the spot.

585
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:39,800
Soldiers,

586
00:38:40,230 --> 00:38:41,960
will you follow me
to suppress the rebels

587
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:43,550
and earn military honors?

588
00:38:50,100 --> 00:38:52,100
(Shenji Battalion)

589
00:39:00,888 --> 00:39:02,296
(Garrison Supervisor Li,
Fifth-Rank Right Deputy Director)

590
00:39:02,300 --> 00:39:03,432
(of the Imperial Horse Directorate)

591
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:08,760
Earn military honors!

592
00:39:09,400 --> 00:39:11,360
- Earn military honors!
- Earn military honors!

593
00:39:11,630 --> 00:39:21,440
- Earn military honors!
- Earn military honors!

594
00:39:21,440 --> 00:39:22,670
Soldiers, heed my command.

595
00:39:23,400 --> 00:39:24,510
Follow me to the armory

596
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:25,920
and collect your firearms.

597
00:39:26,110 --> 00:39:27,000
- Yes.
- Yes.

598
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:52,550
Lin Jinqi colluded with the rebels

599
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:54,480
and attacked his superior,

600
00:39:55,070 --> 00:39:58,550
murdering Vice Commander Chen
and the two supervising eunuchs.

601
00:39:59,368 --> 00:40:00,710
Soldiers of the Shenji Battalion,

602
00:40:01,110 --> 00:40:02,510
seize him at once.

603
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:05,550
Follow me into the capital
to defend the Emperor.

604
00:40:05,992 --> 00:40:07,550
Prince Han is twisting the truth.

605
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,360
Don't be deceived by his lies.

606
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:16,960
Young Master!

607
00:40:17,920 --> 00:40:18,670
Young Master!

608
00:40:21,110 --> 00:40:23,190
Young Master, wake up!

609
00:40:23,280 --> 00:40:24,030
Young Master!

610
00:40:24,320 --> 00:40:25,000
Young Master!

611
00:40:25,590 --> 00:40:26,360
Young Master!

612
00:40:27,590 --> 00:40:29,670
Young Master, wake up! Young Master!

613
00:40:29,670 --> 00:40:31,400
Drag him away and behead him.

614
00:40:31,960 --> 00:40:33,190
Chop up his body

615
00:40:33,336 --> 00:40:34,710
and feed it to the wild dogs.

616
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:36,000
Young Master!

617
00:40:36,230 --> 00:40:37,030
Young Master!

618
00:40:37,544 --> 00:40:38,590
Young Master, wake up!

619
00:40:38,590 --> 00:40:39,320
Young Master!

620
00:40:39,590 --> 00:40:40,190
Young Master!

621
00:40:42,510 --> 00:40:44,710
Anyone else who dares defy me

622
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:47,590
will meet the same fate as Lin Jinqi.

623
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:49,920
Those who follow me

624
00:40:50,480 --> 00:40:53,320
into the capital to defend His Majesty

625
00:40:54,150 --> 00:40:57,800
will be promoted three ranks
and rewarded with 100 taels of gold.

626
00:40:58,024 --> 00:41:00,260
(Wei Bao, Prince Han's Personal Guard)
Enter the capital

627
00:41:00,270 --> 00:41:02,270
(Fifth-Rank Company Commander)
and defend His Majesty!

628
00:41:02,280 --> 00:41:19,000
- Enter the capital and defend His Majesty!
- Enter the capital and defend His Majesty!

629
00:41:21,070 --> 00:41:23,150
Once we have the firearms,

630
00:41:24,230 --> 00:41:28,360
follow me into the city
to suppress the rebels.

631
00:41:28,440 --> 00:41:29,190
- Yes.
- Yes.

632
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:38,670
The armory is just ahead.

633
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:40,312
But to collect the firearms,

634
00:41:40,328 --> 00:41:41,920
we still need the key

635
00:41:41,920 --> 00:41:44,152
and the authority tokens
of the two supervising eunuchs.

636
00:41:44,320 --> 00:41:46,280
Kill anyone who refuses.

637
00:41:52,150 --> 00:41:53,320
How was this door opened?

638
00:41:54,440 --> 00:41:56,650
Deputy Commander Lin
had the key and authority tokens.

639
00:41:56,670 --> 00:41:58,296
He was ordered to inspect the firearms,

640
00:41:58,630 --> 00:42:00,670
so we opened the door and let him in.

641
00:42:01,230 --> 00:42:02,280
Lin Jinqi?

642
00:42:03,510 --> 00:42:04,920
Wasn't he... wasn't he dead?

643
00:42:14,680 --> 00:42:16,070
Prince Han is twisting the truth.

644
00:42:16,360 --> 00:42:17,880
Don't be deceived by his lies.

645
00:42:25,630 --> 00:42:27,280
Drag him away and behead him.

646
00:42:27,760 --> 00:42:28,920
Chop up his body

647
00:42:28,984 --> 00:42:30,190
and feed it to the wild dogs!

648
00:42:30,960 --> 00:42:31,670
Young Master!

649
00:42:32,760 --> 00:42:33,550
Young Master!

650
00:42:37,070 --> 00:42:37,880
Young Master!

651
00:42:38,630 --> 00:42:39,320
Young Master!

652
00:42:39,360 --> 00:42:41,510
Anyone else who dares defy me

653
00:42:42,030 --> 00:42:43,800
will meet the same fate as Lin Jinqi!

654
00:43:05,220 --> 00:43:07,380
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

655
00:43:45,660 --> 00:43:48,220
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

656
00:43:48,220 --> 00:43:52,940
♪For withholding its light♪

657
00:43:53,500 --> 00:43:56,780
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

658
00:43:57,630 --> 00:44:00,190
Lin Jinqi ruined my plans.

659
00:44:00,440 --> 00:44:04,070
Only his death will satisfy my hatred!

660
00:44:20,181 --> 00:44:24,301
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

661
00:44:27,141 --> 00:44:31,661
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

662
00:44:32,941 --> 00:44:36,861
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

663
00:44:37,541 --> 00:44:40,301
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

664
00:44:41,021 --> 00:44:43,341
♪Though all the world may fade♪

665
00:44:43,341 --> 00:44:46,421
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

666
00:44:47,941 --> 00:44:52,181
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

667
00:44:55,101 --> 00:44:59,261
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

668
00:45:01,061 --> 00:45:04,621
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

669
00:45:04,621 --> 00:45:08,181
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

670
00:45:08,981 --> 00:45:14,661
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

671
00:45:15,021 --> 00:45:19,341
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

672
00:45:19,701 --> 00:45:22,661
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

673
00:45:22,661 --> 00:45:26,421
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

674
00:45:26,421 --> 00:45:29,301
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

675
00:45:29,301 --> 00:45:33,381
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

676
00:45:33,381 --> 00:45:36,741
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

677
00:45:36,741 --> 00:45:40,501
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

678
00:45:40,501 --> 00:45:44,501
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

679
00:45:45,261 --> 00:45:49,421
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

680
00:45:49,421 --> 00:45:52,861
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

681
